      "text": "$526$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1uexZ",
      "text": "$784$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\r\n& a_1 a_5=28 \\Rightarrow a^2 r^4=28 \\\\\r\n& a_2+a_4=29 \\Rightarrow a r+a r^3=29\r\n\\end{aligned}$\r\nar and $a r^3$ are roots of\r\n$\\begin{aligned}\r\n& k^2-29 k+28=0 \\\\\r\n& \\Rightarrow \\quad k=1, k=28 \\\\\r\n& a r=1, a r^3=28 \\\\\r\n& r^2=28, a^2=\\frac{1}{28} \\\\\r\n& a_6=a r^5 \\Rightarrow r^4=28^2 \\\\\r\n& \\Rightarrow a_6=784\r\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
